## Edge Cases & Special Paths

| Scenario | What Happens |
|----------|-------------|
| Customer pays, network drops before verify callback | Webhook delivers success → order released. Frontend sees success on next poll. |
| Customer tries to pay twice (double-tap) | `pg_advisory_xact_lock` + active attempt check → 409 blocked. |
| Razorpay webhook fires before verify callback | `confirmCapturedPayment()` runs via webhook. Verify path finds Payment=SUCCESS → returns "already processed". |
| Verify fires before webhook | `confirmCapturedPayment()` runs via verify. Webhook fires later → idempotent, skipped. |
| Gateway crashes mid-order-creation | Payment record stays PENDING with no `gatewayOrderId`. Recovery path reconciles via Razorpay order receipt lookup. |
| Customer hits attempt limit | 429 returned. Frontend shows "Contact restaurant" message. |
| Webhook with invalid signature | Rejected. Logged. 200 returned to Razorpay to stop retries. |
| Payment amount mismatch from gateway | 400 PAYMENT_AMOUNT_MISMATCH. Never confirmed. |

