## API Summary

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| `POST` | `/api/payments/razorpay/order` | Initiate / resume a payment attempt |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/razorpay/verify` | Confirm payment from client callback |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/razorpay/reconcile-failure` | Record a known-failed payment from checkout callback |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/webhook` | Receive Razorpay server-side webhook |
| `GET`  | `/api/payments/order/:orderId/attempts` | Fetch all attempts for recovery |

---

## Order Status Lifecycle

```
[Customer places order]
        ↓
  PENDING_PAYMENT    ← order lives here until payment
        ↓ (payment SUCCESS + confirmCapturedPayment)
     PLACED          ← kitchen sees the order
        ↓
    PREPARING
        ↓
      READY
        ↓
    COLLECTED
```

> Token number is assigned **atomically** when order moves from `PENDING_PAYMENT → PLACED`.
